Keep a shared grid as an empty list of whole numbers.
Place 0 into grid.
Place 1 into grid.
Place -1 into grid.
Place 1 into grid.
Place 0 into grid.
Place -1 into grid.
Place 1 into grid.
Place 1 into grid.
Place 1 into grid.
Keep a shared table as an empty list of whole numbers.
For every spot from 0 to 44.
Place -1 into table.

Keep a shared best as 0.
Keep a shared stepnow as 0.
Keep a shared firstnow as 0.
Keep a shared secondnow as 0.
To improve from index (a whole number).
If index is less than 0, return.
If index is at least 45, return.
The candidate is item index of table.
If candidate is more than best, set best to candidate.

To walk.
The firstcolumn is stepnow minus firstnow.
The secondcolumn is stepnow minus secondnow.
If firstcolumn is less than 0, return.
If firstcolumn is at least 3, return.
If secondcolumn is less than 0, return.
If secondcolumn is at least 3, return.
The firstcell is item (firstnow times 3 plus firstcolumn) of grid.
The secondcell is item (secondnow times 3 plus secondcolumn) of grid.
If firstcell is -1, return.
If secondcell is -1, return.
Set best to -1.
The base is (stepnow minus 1) times 9.
The above is firstnow minus 1.
The beside is secondnow minus 1.
The topstripe is above times 3.
The firststripe is firstnow times 3.
The secondstripe is secondnow times 3.
The upleft is base plus topstripe plus beside.
The upright is base plus firststripe plus beside.
The downleft is base plus topstripe plus secondnow.
The downright is base plus firststripe plus secondnow.
Improve from upleft.
Improve from upright.
Improve from downleft.
Improve from downright.
If best is less than 0, return.
The gain is firstcell.
If firstnow is not secondnow, set gain to gain plus secondcell.
The slot is stepnow times 9.
The spot is slot plus firststripe plus secondnow.
Set item spot of table to best plus gain.

If item 0 of grid is not -1, set item 0 of table to item 0 of grid.
For every step from 1 to 4.
For every firstrow from 0 to 2.
For every secondrow from 0 to 2.
Set stepnow to step.
Set firstnow to firstrow.
Set secondnow to secondrow.
Walk.

The answer is item 44 of table.
If answer is less than 0, show 0, otherwise show answer.
